The boot transcript below is a DragonFly amd64 serial console transcript,
hand-written for this fixture in the shape the boot test looks at: it
starts at the kernel banner and ends at the login prompt. It is used by
tests/fixtures/fake-provider.sh as the canned serial log of the fake VM,
and the "no login prompt" case is derived from it by cutting the
transcript before the prompt.

